# Fishcommerce — Implementation Plan

A modern, client-side pet fish e-commerce application with a customer storefront and admin portal.

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Choice | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| Framework | **Vite + React** | Fast dev server, modern bundler |
| Routing | **React Router v7** | Standard SPA routing with nested routes |
| Styling | **Vanilla CSS** with CSS variables | Per design-system spec, maximum control |
| State | **React Context** + `useReducer` | No external deps; Cart, Auth, Orders, Products |
| Persistence | **localStorage** | Survives refresh; no backend needed |
| Fonts | **Plus Jakarta Sans** via Google Fonts | Brand typography |
| Animation | **CSS animations + JS** | Betta fish tank animation, micro-interactions |

---

## Architecture

```
src/
├── main.jsx                 # App entry, router mount
├── App.jsx                  # Router + layout wrapper
├── index.css                # Design tokens, resets, global styles
├── data/
│   └── fishData.js          # Seed product array (12–15 fish)
├── context/
│   ├── AuthContext.jsx       # Login, signup, guest, profile state
│   ├── CartContext.jsx       # Cart items, add/remove/quantity
│   ├── OrderContext.jsx      # Orders, status transitions, notifications
│   └── ProductContext.jsx    # Products CRUD, backed by localStorage
├── components/
│   ├── Navbar.jsx + Navbar.css
│   ├── Footer.jsx + Footer.css
│   ├── ProductCard.jsx + ProductCard.css
│   ├── FilterBar.jsx + FilterBar.css
│   ├── Modal.jsx + Modal.css
│   └── Toast.jsx + Toast.css
├── pages/
│   ├── Home.jsx + Home.css                   # Hero section + trust strip
│   ├── Catalog.jsx + Catalog.css             # Product grid + filters
│   ├── ProductDetail.jsx + ProductDetail.css # Single product view
│   ├── Checkout.jsx + Checkout.css           # Auth gate + order form
│   ├── OrderSuccess.jsx + OrderSuccess.css   # Confirmation card
│   ├── admin/
│   │   ├── AdminLayout.jsx + AdminLayout.css # Top-bar + tab nav wrapper
│   │   ├── AdminProducts.jsx + AdminProducts.css   # Product CRUD table
│   │   └── AdminOrders.jsx + AdminOrders.css       # Order management table
│   └── Auth.jsx + Auth.css                   # Login / Signup page
└── assets/                   # Generated fish images, logo
```

