## Proposed Changes

### Design System & Global Styles

#### [NEW] [index.css](file:///d:/Project/Other%20projects/Ganesh/Fish_commerce/src/index.css)
- CSS custom properties (`:root`) for all design tokens from the spec
- Import Plus Jakarta Sans from Google Fonts
- Reset styles, body defaults, utility classes
- Button variant classes (`.btn-primary`, `.btn-secondary`, `.btn-outline`)
- Card base styles, badge pill styles, transitions

---

### Data Layer

#### [NEW] [fishData.js](file:///d:/Project/Other%20projects/Ganesh/Fish_commerce/src/data/fishData.js)
- Array of 12–15 fish objects, each with: `id`, `name`, `price`, `image`, `category` (Freshwater/Saltwater), `careLevel`, `temperament`, `minTankSize`, `diet`, `waterType`, `description`, `stock`, `badges[]`
- Serves as initial seed; ProductContext copies to localStorage on first load

#### [NEW] [AuthContext.jsx](file:///d:/Project/Other%20projects/Ganesh/Fish_commerce/src/context/AuthContext.jsx)
- `user` state (null = guest, object = logged in)
- `login(email, password)`, `signup(name, email, password)`, `logout()`
- `isAdmin` flag (hardcoded admin credentials: `admin@fishcommerce.com`)
- Persists to localStorage

#### [NEW] [CartContext.jsx](file:///d:/Project/Other%20projects/Ganesh/Fish_commerce/src/context/CartContext.jsx)
- `items[]` with `{ productId, quantity }`
- `addToCart`, `removeFromCart`, `updateQuantity`, `clearCart`, `cartTotal` derived value
- Persists to localStorage

#### [NEW] [OrderContext.jsx](file:///d:/Project/Other%20projects/Ganesh/Fish_commerce/src/context/OrderContext.jsx)
- `orders[]` array with `{ id, items, customer, address, status, createdAt }`
- `placeOrder(orderData)` — generates UUID, pushes to array
- `updateOrderStatus(orderId, newStatus)` — Confirmed/Shipped/Delivered
- `pendingCount` derived for admin badge
- Persists to localStorage

#### [NEW] [ProductContext.jsx](file:///d:/Project/Other%20projects/Ganesh/Fish_commerce/src/context/ProductContext.jsx)
- Initializes from localStorage, falls back to `fishData.js` seed
- `addProduct`, `updateProduct`, `deleteProduct`, `toggleAvailability`
- Persists every mutation to localStorage

